      "time": "~20s",
      "narrative": "In Observe we found where the agent slips. Now we use that same evaluation setup to fix it. \n\nWe have two goals: \n\n\n1)\tMake our agent more accurate\n\n2) Improve our cost of operating at the same level of accuracy",
      "demo_actions": "Bridge directly from the Observe chapter. Frame this as the next step after tracing and evals: we know where the agent is weak, and now we use Agent Optimizer to improve the configuration before changing models.",
