      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "Agent Optimizer takes the evaluation set from Observe and runs the loop: it scores the baseline, tests candidates, and ranks the results. \n",
      "demo_actions": "Open the Agent Optimizer overview or Optimize tab. Connect it to the prior chapter by explaining that the evals from Observe now become the basis for optimization.",
