      "time": "~30s",
      "narrative": "What it tunes is the setup — the instructions, the skills, and the tools. We are not swapping the model. We are making the configuration around it work better. ",
      "demo_actions": "Show the optimization targets in the docs. Highlight instruction tuning, skill improvement, and tool optimization. Note that model selection exists, but it is out of scope for this sketch.",
